# Scriptable requests for REST Client or translate directly to curl.
# Supply real values through secure local environment settings; never commit them.
@base = https://STAGING_WORKER_HOST
@schoolCode = FICTIONAL_SCHOOL_CODE
@loginId = ISSUED_LOGIN_ID
@password = ENVIRONMENT_SECRET
@csrf = TOKEN_RETURNED_BY_LOGIN
@version = EXAM_VERSION_UUID
@writer = PER_TAB_RANDOM_UUID
@attempt = ATTEMPT_UUID
@question = QUESTION_UUID

### Health; not proof of a full workflow
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Explicit school sign-in (cookie jar managed by the HTTP client)
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/login
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolCode":"{{schoolCode}}","loginId":"{{loginId}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Session resume
GET {{base}}/v1/auth/session

### Student start/resume, with a stable per-tab writer UUID
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/start
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"versionId":"{{version}}","writer":"{{writer}}"}

### Versioned acknowledged save; response uses stable option ID, not displayed letter
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/answers
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","questionId":"{{question}}","writer":"{{writer}}","revision":1,"response":null}

### Idempotent finalization
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/submit
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","writer":"{{writer}}"}

### Teacher review (hundredths of a mark)
POST {{base}}/v1/grades/review
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","questionId":"{{question}}","score":300,"revision":1,"feedback":"Reviewed feedback","reason":"Teacher review"}

### Teacher publication requires all questions reviewed
POST {{base}}/v1/results/publish
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","reason":"Teacher publication"}

### Published-only student progress
POST {{base}}/v1/reports/student
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Class-scoped school report (administrator/assigned teacher)
POST {{base}}/v1/reports/school
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"academicYear":"2026","limit":25,"offset":0}

### Owner-only school creation
POST {{base}}/v1/schools
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"fictional-school","name":"Fictional School","timezone":"Asia/Kolkata","plan":"Pilot","startsAt":"2026-11-07T00:00:00Z","endsAt":"2027-11-07T00:00:00Z","teacherLimit":10,"studentLimit":100,"aiLimit":100}

### Sign out clears the application session
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/logout
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# Complete operation request schemas are in openapi.json. This sample collection
# contains role-scoped examples; use the complete OpenAPI schemas for ancillary operations.

### Additional role workflows; switch the authenticated cookie jar for each role.
# Replace UUID variables with prior API responses. No credentials are stored here.
@school = SCHOOL_UUID
@class = CLASS_UUID
@teacher = TEACHER_UUID
@student = STUDENT_UUID
@group = GROUP_UUID
@query = QUERY_UUID
@profile = PROFILE_UUID
@article = ARTICLE_UUID
@articleRevision = ARTICLE_REVISION_UUID
@attachment = ATTACHMENT_UUID

### Administrator creates a class
POST {{base}}/v1/classes
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"academicYear":"2026","name":"9","section":"B"}

### Parent-role provisioning: owner issues an administrator; administrator issues a teacher
# Use the appropriate role/class fields from OpenAPI; credentials are issue-only.
POST {{base}}/v1/accounts
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{school}}","role":"teacher","name":"Synthetic Teacher","loginId":"Synthetic.Teacher","identityKey":"synthetic-teacher-example"}

### Administrator assigns the teacher
POST {{base}}/v1/assignments
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teacherId":"{{teacher}}","classId":"{{class}}","subject":"Computing"}

### Teacher/admin downloads the Excel template; populate synthetic rows only
GET {{base}}/v1/imports/template

### Teacher previews an XLSX file without provisioning
POST {{base}}/v1/imports/preview?classId={{class}}
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: SYNTHETIC_IMPORT_REQUEST_UUID
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./SYNTHETIC_ROSTER.xlsx

### Confirm selected preview rows; continue remainingRows until complete
POST {{base}}/v1/imports/confirm
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jobId":"IMPORT_JOB_UUID","rows":[2,3]}

### Teacher creates a group
POST {{base}}/v1/groups
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"classId":"{{class}}","subject":"Computing","title":"Synthetic study group"}

### Teacher approves a student membership
POST {{base}}/v1/groups/members
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"groupId":"{{group}}","studentId":"{{student}}","state":"active"}

### Student sends a private assigned-teacher query
POST {{base}}/v1/queries
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teacherId":"{{teacher}}","classId":"{{class}}","subject":"Computing","topic":"Loops","body":"Synthetic question about loop conditions"}

### Teacher replies; use kind=solution only for an actual proposed solution
POST {{base}}/v1/queries/replies
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"queryId":"{{query}}","kind":"solution","body":"Synthetic teaching explanation"}

### Student resolves the current query cycle
POST {{base}}/v1/queries/state
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"queryId":"{{query}}","state":"resolved","reason":"Explanation understood"}

### Authorized student dashboard data; blocked during an active attempt
POST {{base}}/v1/dashboard/student
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Teacher submits an article revision (school review is the default)
POST {{base}}/v1/articles/revisions
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileId":"{{profile}}","title":"Synthetic loop lesson","summary":"A short teaching explanation","subject":"Computing","body":"Practise **loop conditions**.","state":"submitted"}

### Independent article upload; a private group-file ID cannot replace this step
POST {{base}}/v1/files/upload?articleRevisionId={{articleRevision}}
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: SYNTHETIC_PUBLICATION_UPLOAD_UUID
X-Filename: synthetic.pdf
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./SYNTHETIC_DOCUMENT.pdf

### Poll authorized scan/job state; never treat unavailable scanning as clean
POST {{base}}/v1/files/status
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"{{attachment}}"}

### Administrator explicitly approves text and independently uploaded clean assets
POST {{base}}/v1/articles/moderation
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"articleId":"{{article}}","revisionId":"{{articleRevision}}","action":"publish","audience":"school","assetIds":["{{attachment}}"],"reason":"School reviewed text and attachment"}

### Approved article read; the session still authorizes school-visible content
GET {{base}}/v1/public/articles/{{article}}

### Administrator requests a UTF-8 printable report; download only after the export is ready
POST {{base}}/v1/reports/exports
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId":"{{student}}","format":"printable","academicYear":"2026"}

### Platform owner sign-in uses the same secure session lifecycle
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/owner-login
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolCode":"platform","loginId":"owner","password":"{{password}}"}

### Staff resets an authorized student; currentPassword is the staff actor's password
# Response issues a new password once and invalidates the student's old sessions.
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/password
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{student}}","currentPassword":"{{password}}","reason":"Authorized synthetic reset exercise"}

### Administrator creates a school-controlled teacher profile
POST {{base}}/v1/profiles/manage
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"create","teacherId":"{{teacher}}","displayName":"Synthetic Teacher","designation":"Teacher","subjects":[],"classes":[],"reason":"Create synthetic directory entry"}

### Teacher submits a biography for school review
POST {{base}}/v1/profiles/manage
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"draft","profileId":"{{profile}}","content":{"biography":"Synthetic biography for review","teachingApproach":"Synthetic teaching approach","qualifications":"Proposed qualification for school verification","experience":"Proposed experience for school verification"},"reason":"Submit biography for review"}

### Administrator approves only the intended audience; public also requires school public policy
POST {{base}}/v1/profiles/manage
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"approve","profileId":"{{profile}}","revisionId":"PROFILE_REVISION_UUID","audience":"school","reason":"School reviewed biography"}
